A move gives budget to a share past the capability's range.
A holder of one share could hand its budget to any other;
a share's budget moves only through a capability to it.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-grain32 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: a call moved budget to or from a share its caller could not move it on

diff --git a/kernel/syscall.c b/kernel/syscall.c
--- a/kernel/syscall.c
+++ b/kernel/syscall.c
@@ -566,7 +566,7 @@ static int op_share(struct thread *t, uint32_t slot, const struct cap *cap,
         if (!(cap->rights & RIGHT_W)) {
             return KERR_NO_RIGHTS;
         }
-        if (arg[1] >= cap->b || arg[2] >= cap->b) {
+        if (arg[1] >= cap->b) {
             return KERR_INVALID_ARG;
         }
         struct share *from = &shares[cap->a + arg[1]];
